WEBVTT

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:18.000
What's taking the driver so long?

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.500
Yeah.  What's he doing?

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.220
Let's go check on him.

00:00:41.930 --> 00:00:48.070
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:55.210
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:55.990 --> 00:01:01.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:07.860
I was searching for your smile

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:15.230
With our memories fading

00:01:15.770 --> 00:01:22.310
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:29.210
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:36.440
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:55.540 --> 00:02:01.530
Unexpected Enemy

00:02:07.820 --> 00:02:09.140
What?

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:11.370
No one's here.

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:14.680
This place hasn't been used in years.

00:02:15.960 --> 00:02:17.620
He's not in the bathroom.

00:02:18.210 --> 00:02:19.710
What's going on?

00:02:19.710 --> 00:02:20.350
Shh!

00:02:26.030 --> 00:02:28.830
You hear something?

00:02:37.470 --> 00:02:38.540
I do!

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:40.640
It's getting closer!

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:12.940
Who are you?

00:03:12.940 --> 00:03:15.640
We have no money!  Go away!

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:17.180
Partner.

00:03:17.820 --> 00:03:19.620
My other self?

00:03:19.620 --> 00:03:21.340
Change places with me!

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:33.500
What do you want with us?

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:35.830
Are they from Doma?

00:03:40.260 --> 00:03:41.780
Damn!

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:44.110
Everyone!  Run to the car!

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:02.880
Yugi!

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:04.790
This is really bad.

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:10.960
This isn't fair!

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:35.090
What?

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:56.060
What's going on?

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:57.880
Now's our chance!

00:04:57.880 --> 00:04:59.230
R-Right!

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:09.720
Harpie Lady...

00:05:20.890 --> 00:05:22.020
That's...

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:37.740
Oh oh!

00:05:37.740 --> 00:05:39.690
Jonouchi!  Hurry!

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:11.360
Who was that?

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:13.800
It was definitely Mai.

00:06:14.360 --> 00:06:15.420
Say what?

00:06:15.420 --> 00:06:16.280
Mai?

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:26.380
Let's go, Valon.

00:06:31.380 --> 00:06:32.840
Mai Kujaku...

00:06:56.320 --> 00:06:59.510
One of Doma's Three Musketeers - Amelda.

00:07:01.700 --> 00:07:05.240
He was also Gozaburo's victim.

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:08.240
Due to you, my brother...

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:10.840
Your company killed him!

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:14.280
Big brother, what should we do?

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:17.280
Mokuba, you don't need to worry.

00:07:17.280 --> 00:07:22.040
Along with Kaiba Corporation, I also inherited Gozaburo's sins.

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:25.880
I must personally end this problem.

00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:27.600
Big brother...

00:07:28.330 --> 00:07:31.290
They must've taken Pegasus.

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:33.940
But why?

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:38.910
And this card...

00:07:42.740 --> 00:07:44.440
Where am I?

00:07:46.160 --> 00:07:47.940
Am I supposed to remove that?

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:06.460
Why do I know your name?

00:08:07.890 --> 00:08:09.970
Your name is Critias!

00:08:14.850 --> 00:08:18.410
This snuck into my deck.

00:08:18.990 --> 00:08:21.970
Was it magic?  Or a trick?

00:08:21.970 --> 00:08:29.590
Or is some great and mysterious power guiding me?

00:08:34.090 --> 00:08:37.090
Big brother, our company sent you mail.

00:08:37.090 --> 00:08:39.030
Return ASAP.

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:42.620
No.  I'm going to Industrial Illusions.

00:08:42.840 --> 00:08:43.500
Huh?

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:46.450
We may find a lead.

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:56.030
Nobody orders me around.

00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:59.010
I decide my own path.

00:09:00.960 --> 00:09:05.880
I'll defeat anyone who stands in my way!

00:09:18.190 --> 00:09:21.970
Sheesh!  Couldn't you drive straight?

00:09:22.320 --> 00:09:25.180
You wrecked the car!

00:09:25.180 --> 00:09:31.660
Be quiet!  You were so slow that the gas station explosion almost caught us!

00:09:32.580 --> 00:09:35.290
You're saying it's my fault?

00:09:35.290 --> 00:09:36.920
You wanna fight?

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:38.620
Stop!

00:09:39.780 --> 00:09:44.100
Knock it off!  This isn't the time to fight!

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:47.530
That's right.  We need to think of what to do.

00:09:47.530 --> 00:09:51.210
Let's go to Industrial Illusions.

00:09:51.210 --> 00:09:57.380
Yeah.  Since they already took over Pegasus's limousine...

00:09:57.380 --> 00:09:59.500
...I'm worried about Pegasus.

00:09:59.920 --> 00:10:01.220
That's true.

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:04.460
But how do we get there?

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:36.350
So cramped...

00:10:36.350 --> 00:10:38.170
Honda, your suitcase is too big!

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:40.220
So's yours!

00:10:40.440 --> 00:10:43.220
What's in it anyway?

00:10:43.970 --> 00:10:47.260
Something important.  You can take a peek.

00:10:47.760 --> 00:10:48.800
Look.

00:10:48.800 --> 00:10:49.930
What's that for?

00:10:49.930 --> 00:10:51.760
Cultural exchange!

00:10:51.760 --> 00:10:54.460
I'll show Japanese culture to Americans.

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:57.470
You...  Let me see!

00:10:58.600 --> 00:10:59.930
What's this?

00:11:00.210 --> 00:11:02.060
A body pillow!

00:11:02.060 --> 00:11:04.270
I can't sleep without it!

00:11:04.880 --> 00:11:06.310
What are these?

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:09.310
America is stars and stripes!

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:11.750
Give 'em back!

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:14.750
Weren't they fighting a second ago?

00:11:16.470 --> 00:11:18.290
Come to think of it...

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:26.760
Jonouchi, was that really Mai who saved us?

00:11:27.340 --> 00:11:31.700
I saw that she had Harpie Lady.

00:11:34.480 --> 00:11:37.540
That was definitely Mai.

00:11:39.730 --> 00:11:44.640
Since she sent Doma packing, she must be fighting them too.

00:11:45.340 --> 00:11:47.420
That's reassuring.

00:11:47.420 --> 00:11:48.680
True.

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:51.590
Yeah.  Mai was cool.

00:11:52.450 --> 00:11:57.590
If that was Mai, why didn't she talk to us?

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:30.730
What are we doing?

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:34.200
Pipe down!  I can't stand your whining-

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:36.280
Hey!  Be careful!

00:12:37.570 --> 00:12:38.880
He stole my wallet!

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:39.850
What?

00:12:41.170 --> 00:12:43.070
Freeze!

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:51.460
Shit!

00:12:59.430 --> 00:13:00.730
Here.

00:13:00.730 --> 00:13:02.810
It's yours, right?

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:09.860
Wow!  I didn't know you're best friends with Yugi!

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:14.800
America is huge.  What a coincidence that we meet!

00:13:15.260 --> 00:13:16.530
Best friends?

00:13:16.970 --> 00:13:18.750
Huh?  You're not?

00:13:18.750 --> 00:13:20.330
No.  We're-

00:13:20.330 --> 00:13:21.330
Yes!  Yes!

00:13:21.330 --> 00:13:24.330
We're the bestest friends!

00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:27.260
Just go with the flow.

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:34.700
And you said that Yugi had all three of his God Cards stolen?

00:13:34.700 --> 00:13:40.650
Everyone knows that Yugi won the Battle City Tournament and acquired the God Cards.

00:13:40.650 --> 00:13:42.780
So people are after him.

00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:45.840
Because they're the ultimate rare cards.

00:13:47.020 --> 00:13:53.440
So we came to America to retrieve the God Cards for our dear friend.

00:13:53.440 --> 00:13:57.880
We thought we'd learn something if we met the creator, Pegasus.

00:13:57.880 --> 00:13:59.820
Okay.  I understand.

00:13:59.820 --> 00:14:03.350
I'm worried too because I can't get in touch with Pegasus.

00:14:03.620 --> 00:14:04.780
Perfect timing.

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:07.720
Let's go to Industrial Illusions.

00:14:07.720 --> 00:14:08.920
All right!

00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:38.690
This is Industrial Illusions?

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:40.090
Wow!

00:14:40.090 --> 00:14:40.670
Let's go.

00:14:40.670 --> 00:14:41.890
Okay!

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:50.130
No one's here.

00:14:50.130 --> 00:14:51.830
Are they closed today?

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:55.770
Then why are the doors unlocked?  It's strange.

00:14:57.270 --> 00:14:59.760
Be careful, my other self.

00:14:59.760 --> 00:15:02.130
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:03.920
Yeah, I know.

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:08.720
From the moment we entered, I've been sensing a powerful threat.

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:14.940
The phones are out.

00:15:21.380 --> 00:15:22.640
What's going on?

00:15:25.560 --> 00:15:26.840
Damn!  It won't open!

00:15:27.150 --> 00:15:28.240
Same here!

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:29.770
It won't open!

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:31.980
This is...

00:16:07.510 --> 00:16:08.550
Mai!

00:16:08.550 --> 00:16:09.690
Mai!

00:16:10.270 --> 00:16:13.280
See!  Told you so!

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:16.980
Way to make an entrance, Mai!

00:16:19.680 --> 00:16:22.710
Mai, did Pegasus invite you too?

00:16:24.650 --> 00:16:28.130
Be careful.  Something weird is going on.

00:16:29.440 --> 00:16:32.120
Pegasus is gone.

00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:37.360
Pegasus...

00:16:42.340 --> 00:16:43.380
You're...

00:16:48.640 --> 00:16:51.260
You're Mai Kujaku.

00:16:52.410 --> 00:16:54.650
Why are you here?

00:16:55.370 --> 00:16:59.790
Pegasus, I'm taking your soul!

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:01.020
What?

00:17:12.640 --> 00:17:15.110
My turn!  I draw!

00:17:21.050 --> 00:17:24.980
I activate my spell card, Harpie Lady Phoenix Formation!

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:31.940
For every Harpie Lady on my field, one of your monsters is destroyed!

00:17:33.980 --> 00:17:35.930
No!

00:17:44.070 --> 00:17:50.310
And you lose life points equal to the total attack points of your destroyed monsters!

00:17:54.490 --> 00:17:58.480
No!

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:17.040
I took care of Pegasus.

00:18:17.050 --> 00:18:18.090
Mai!

00:18:18.090 --> 00:18:20.060
N-No way!

00:18:20.060 --> 00:18:22.810
Impossible!  You wouldn't do that, Mai!

00:18:22.810 --> 00:18:25.260
Mai, why did you do that?

00:18:28.030 --> 00:18:32.550
Mai Kujaku wants to defeat you personally.

00:18:32.760 --> 00:18:33.490
What?

00:18:33.490 --> 00:18:37.450
Mai, Pegasus is supposed to be your only target.

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:40.930
We're facing the Nameless Pharaoh and Jonouchi!

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:45.160
I'm dueling them!  You stay out of this!

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:46.380
Mai!

00:18:47.140 --> 00:18:49.330
How can you say that, Mai?

00:18:49.820 --> 00:18:55.790
When I was with all of you, I had so much fun that I lost track of time.

00:18:55.790 --> 00:18:56.840
But...

00:18:57.620 --> 00:19:02.380
Your friendship is too bright for me.

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:05.950
Good luck.

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:07.700
You too.

00:19:09.410 --> 00:19:12.440
Why?  What's gotten into you?

00:19:12.440 --> 00:19:14.400
Explain!

00:19:15.100 --> 00:19:17.690
Damn!  She betrayed us!

00:19:17.690 --> 00:19:19.960
She must have a good reason.

00:19:19.960 --> 00:19:22.370
Or Mai wouldn't do this.

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:24.870
Did Doma do something to you?

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:30.880
If you want to leave, you must defeat me in a duel.

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:36.410
Jonouchi!  I'll face you first!

00:19:38.350 --> 00:19:41.020
Here I go!  It's my turn!  I draw!

00:19:42.520 --> 00:19:47.030
Jonouchi, I'm not the same Mai Kujaku as before.

00:19:47.260 --> 00:19:49.260
I'm reborn!

00:19:49.480 --> 00:19:52.880
I have obtained a new power - the Orichalcos!

00:19:52.880 --> 00:19:58.280
The spell card infused with darkness, awaken my dark soul!

00:19:59.240 --> 00:20:00.800
The Field Spell...

00:20:01.540 --> 00:20:03.720
The Seal of Orichalcos!

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:12.780
This is...

00:20:26.270 --> 00:20:29.900
Stop it, Mai!  I don't want to fight you!

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:46.190
Mai?

00:20:48.380 --> 00:20:50.730
The Seal of Orichalcos.

00:20:50.730 --> 00:20:54.890
Only the winner of the duel can leave the circle.

00:20:54.890 --> 00:20:59.020
Why do Mai and Jonouchi have to duel?

00:20:59.410 --> 00:21:02.070
This duel is too much.

00:21:02.540 --> 00:21:04.500
Mai, you...

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:11.340
Come here, Harpie Lady!

00:21:11.690 --> 00:21:14.350
Gain the power of Orichalcos!

00:21:22.620 --> 00:21:25.140
Inside The Seal of Orichalcos...

00:21:25.140 --> 00:21:30.800
...all my monsters become Dark monsters and gain 500 attack points.

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:32.730
Stop this, Mai!

00:21:34.290 --> 00:21:35.740
I end my turn.

00:21:35.740 --> 00:21:38.670
Jonouchi, it's your turn.

00:21:39.390 --> 00:21:47.560
No.  I don't want to fight you like this!

00:21:58.540 --> 00:22:07.450
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:07.950 --> 00:22:15.790
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:17.520 --> 00:22:26.950
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:27.570 --> 00:22:36.470
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:45.500
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:46.280 --> 00:22:51.010
I'll live feeling them

00:22:51.620 --> 00:22:56.190
For me to be me

00:22:56.190 --> 00:23:04.650
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:05.330 --> 00:23:10.290
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:10.810 --> 00:23:19.950
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:26.400 --> 00:23:31.260
Mai was waiting for us at Industrial Illusions!

00:23:31.820 --> 00:23:34.680
Mai said she captured Pegasus's soul.

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:38.820
She used The Seal of Orichalcos and challenged Jonouchi to a duel.

00:23:38.820 --> 00:23:42.480
Stop it!  You shouldn't be dueling like this!

00:23:42.480 --> 00:23:44.630
What happened to you, Mai?

00:23:44.630 --> 00:23:47.340
Are you really our enemy?

00:23:47.930 --> 00:23:50.380
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Mai Who Fell Into Darkness

00:23:50.380 --> 00:23:52.160
Duel, standby!
